diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
index 91190dc..586dadd 100644
--- a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -2,6 +2,15 @@
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Opted-in ACP clients retain native approval modes, automatic retry/compaction, model service tiers, local MCP tools, and live child-agent events.
+- ACP clients can negotiate versioned `_session/settled` notifications to wait for background result turns, correlate completion to their prompt, and receive native terminal error details.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- ACP `--no-session` discovery no longer writes a native conversation.
+
 ## [18.12.6] - 2026-10-21
 
 ### Added
